    "long_instructions": "<h1>\r\nReviewing Code Changes\r\n</h1>\r\n<p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Prompt AI Tutor to update the hero section with:</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A dark background</li>\r\n<li>White text</li>\r\n<li>More padding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>After AI Tutor finishes generating, review the code to see what changed, and accept the changes.</li>\r\n<li>In the description box that appears after you accept changes, type in the new values AI Tutor used for:</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The hero <span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;\">background-color</span></li>\r\n<li>The hero text <span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;\">color</span></li>\r\n<li>The hero <span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;\">padding</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>",
